Package: thermify
Title: Efficient Agroclimatic Thermal Indices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Guillermo", "Fuentes-Jaque", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gfuentesj@correo.uss.cl")
Description: Calculates growing degree days and estimates chilling hours from
    daily minimum and maximum temperatures. Includes a development roadmap for
    efficient spatial processing of monthly climatologies and optional temporal
    interpolation through tempify. Outputs based on monthly climatologies are
    model-based estimates, not observed daily or hourly temperatures.
